      "message": "[error] Line 199: 🔴 `videoScaling` is never reset when (re)binding media, so after a user switches to fill, subsequent full-screen openings in the same coordinator lifecycle can start in fill instead of fit. That contradicts the change contract (\u0027opens fitted\u0027). Reset `videoScaling` to `.aspectFit` in the coordinator’s bind/open path (e.g., when binding a new media item or when entering full-screen).",
